{"title":"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the following flowchart:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>If the OUTPUT is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the INPUT must have been\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/6/e96854328a74cdf9a7c000c4f2634fb02f2513ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   16 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   28 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   36 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   40 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   32 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"430\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the last step added <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the number beforehand was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/4/9446abedff6a73beb9f2fb4adba52330d4ecd2ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32 - 16 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since the number was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> after being divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the number was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/9/8e9a2797ecbac08c3a9b93ab5f0cf71575a2cd97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 \\times 2 = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> before that.\n</p><p>Since the number was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> was subtracted from the input, the input was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/2/4a27dc5fa366352bd02e3c2f99863154e8be04bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32 + 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"141\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the input be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. The resulting number after subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb569c1445b064b8df22cb1196f9424f478fcaf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>After dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the number was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/0362ed8f5264a28983c52c49e19f1c4500fd0346.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x - 8}{2} = \\frac{x}{2} - \\frac{8}{2} = \\frac{1}{2}x - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>After adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the number was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aa8a5d883516c09cf0bd9420628fc7b9f80dfca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}x - 4 + 16 = \\frac{1}{2}x + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"185\" height=\"38\" />, which is also the output. Since the output is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/3/2439d670a150a54e94ee4445802d69a871996165.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}x + 12 = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"108\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/e/b1e16c3f53461c71ed78c76fd0f956557a12de06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}x = 32 - 12 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"151\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/0/8509bd836baac226a56029950cc221d2c5d2739c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 20 \\times 2 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"176\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley\">2014 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Probl